  "title": "Gulf Coast is ours",
  "briefing": "Tidewater Consortium holds Gulf Coast through its container park. Reconnect 2 relays, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Gulf Coast Uplink: Tidewater Consortium runs Gulf Coast from its container park, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Gulf Coast wakes up with the container park in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Gulf Coast before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
